{"newsletter_confirmation": {"subject": "Du er påmeldt nyhetsbrevet fra His Kingdom Ministry", "body": "<div class=\"hkm-email-container\" style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f5ed;\"><!-- hkm-design-2026 #FCF9F5 -->\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;\">Takk for at du vil følge arbeidet vårt. Her er hva du kan vente deg.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f5f5ed\" style=\"background:#f5f5ed;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;\">\n<tr><td style=\"padding:0 4px 16px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n  <td><img src=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/img/logo-hkm.png\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;border-radius:50%;\"></td>\n  <td style=\"padding-left:10px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#151a21;\">His Kingdom Ministry</td>\n</tr></table></td></tr>\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid #e6e4dc;\">\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n    <td bgcolor=\"#151a21\" style=\"background:#151a21;border-radius:20px 20px 0 0;padding:30px 32px 28px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffffff;\">Nyhetsbrev</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:28px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#ffffff;\">Takk for at du <span style=\"color:#cc712b;\">følger med</span></p>\n    </td></tr></table>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"padding:32px 32px 24px;\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#151a21;\">Hei!</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#151a21;\">Så fint at du vil følge arbeidet vårt. Du er nå påmeldt nyhetsbrevet fra His Kingdom Ministry.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;\"><tr><td style=\"background:#f5f5ed;border-left:4px solid #cc712b;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:20px 22px;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a0531a;\">Påmeldt</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700;color:#151a21;\">Du er registrert</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 0px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#596069;\">Vi har lagt til e-postadressen {{email}}.</p></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.65;color:#151a21;\">Dette får du fra oss</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 24px;\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 12px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;width:28px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#fbf1e8;color:#cc712b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;line-height:24px;text-align:center;\">1</div></td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#151a21;\"><strong>Undervisning</strong> og bibelstudier som hjelper deg å vokse i troen.</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 12px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;width:28px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#fbf1e8;color:#cc712b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;line-height:24px;text-align:center;\">2</div></td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#151a21;\"><strong>Leseplaner</strong> og bønneplaner du kan følge sammen med oss.</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 12px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;width:28px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#fbf1e8;color:#cc712b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;line-height:24px;text-align:center;\">3</div></td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#151a21;\"><strong>Nytt fra tjenesten</strong> – podcast, arrangementer og hva Gud gjør.</td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"display:inline-table;margin:0 8px 8px 0;\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#cc712b\" style=\"border-radius:12px;\"><a href=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/undervisning\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:12px;\">Se undervisning</a></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"display:inline-table;margin:0 8px 8px 0;\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#151a21\" style=\"border-radius:12px;\"><a href=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/leseplaner\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:12px;\">Leseplaner</a></td></tr></table>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:0 32px 28px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n    <td style=\"border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;padding-top:20px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#151a21;\">Vennlig hilsen<br><strong>His Kingdom Ministry</strong></td>\n  </tr></table></td></tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:22px 8px 8px;text-align:center;\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#151a21;\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/\" style=\"color:#151a21;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">Nettsiden</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/minside\" style=\"color:#151a21;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">Min side</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/kontakt\" style=\"color:#151a21;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">Kontakt</a>\n  </p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#596069;\">Du får denne e-posten fordi du meldte deg på nyhetsbrevet på hiskingdomministry.no.<br><a href=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/avmeld\" style=\"color:#596069;text-decoration:underline;\">Meld deg av nyhetsbrevet</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; © 2026 His Kingdom Ministry</p>\n</td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></table>\n</div>"}, "faste_confirmation": {"subject": "Du er påmeldt fastehilsenene – vi starter 4. januar", "body": "<div class=\"hkm-email-container\" style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f5ed;\"><!-- hkm-design-2026 #FCF9F5 -->\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;\">Takk for at du er med! Du får en hilsen hver mandag i de tre ukene.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f5f5ed\" style=\"background:#f5f5ed;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;\">\n<tr><td style=\"padding:0 4px 16px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n  <td><img src=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/img/logo-hkm.png\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;border-radius:50%;\"></td>\n  <td style=\"padding-left:10px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#151a21;\">His Kingdom Ministry</td>\n</tr></table></td></tr>\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid #e6e4dc;\">\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n    <td bgcolor=\"#151a21\" style=\"background:#151a21;border-radius:20px 20px 0 0;padding:30px 32px 28px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffffff;\">Bønn og faste · 4.–24. januar</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:28px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#ffffff;\">21 dager med <span style=\"color:#cc712b;\">bønn og faste</span></p>\n    </td></tr></table>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"padding:32px 32px 24px;\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#151a21;\">Hei!</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#151a21;\">Takk for at du vil være med på 21 dager med bønn og faste! Vi gleder oss til å gå disse ukene sammen med deg.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;\"><tr><td style=\"background:#f5f5ed;border-left:4px solid #cc712b;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:20px 22px;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a0531a;\">Påmeldt</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700;color:#151a21;\">Du får tre hilsener</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 0px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#596069;\">Vi sender dem til {{email}} – én hver mandag, med tema for uken, bønneemner og en oppmuntring.</p></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 24px;\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 12px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;width:28px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#fbf1e8;color:#cc712b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;line-height:24px;text-align:center;\">1</div></td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#151a21;\"><strong>Mandag 4. januar</strong> – Tilbake til kilden</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 12px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;width:28px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#fbf1e8;color:#cc712b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;line-height:24px;text-align:center;\">2</div></td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#151a21;\"><strong>Mandag 11. januar</strong> – Fri til å følge</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 12px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;width:28px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#fbf1e8;color:#cc712b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;line-height:24px;text-align:center;\">3</div></td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#151a21;\"><strong>Mandag 18. januar</strong> – Sendt ut med håp</td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#151a21;\">Du kan allerede nå lese deg opp på faste-siden og i leseplanen.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"display:inline-table;margin:0 8px 8px 0;\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#cc712b\" style=\"border-radius:12px;\"><a href=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/faste\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:12px;\">Se faste-siden</a></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"display:inline-table;margin:0 8px 8px 0;\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#151a21\" style=\"border-radius:12px;\"><a href=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/leseplan-detaljer?id=21-dager-bonn-og-faste\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:12px;\">Åpne leseplanen</a></td></tr></table>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:0 32px 28px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n    <td style=\"border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;padding-top:20px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#151a21;\">Vennlig hilsen<br><strong>His Kingdom Ministry</strong></td>\n  </tr></table></td></tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:22px 8px 8px;text-align:center;\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#151a21;\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/\" style=\"color:#151a21;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">Nettsiden</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/minside\" style=\"color:#151a21;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">Min side</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/kontakt\" style=\"color:#151a21;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">Kontakt</a>\n  </p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#596069;\">Du får denne e-posten fordi du meldte deg på fastehilsener på hiskingdomministry.no/faste.<br><a href=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/avmeld\" style=\"color:#596069;text-decoration:underline;\">Meld deg av</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; © 2026 His Kingdom Ministry</p>\n</td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></table>\n</div>"}, "welcome_email": {"subject": "Velkommen til His Kingdom Ministry!", "body": "<div class=\"hkm-email-container\" style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f5ed;\"><!-- hkm-design-2026 #FCF9F5 -->\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;\">Kontoen din er klar. Her er det du kan gjøre på Min side.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f5f5ed\" style=\"background:#f5f5ed;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;\">\n<tr><td style=\"padding:0 4px 16px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n  <td><img src=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/img/logo-hkm.png\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;border-radius:50%;\"></td>\n  <td style=\"padding-left:10px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#151a21;\">His Kingdom Ministry</td>\n</tr></table></td></tr>\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid #e6e4dc;\">\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n    <td bgcolor=\"#151a21\" style=\"background:#151a21;border-radius:20px 20px 0 0;padding:30px 32px 28px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffffff;\">Velkommen</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:28px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#ffffff;\">Velkommen, <span style=\"color:#cc712b;\">{{name}}</span>!</p>\n    </td></tr></table>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"padding:32px 32px 24px;\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#151a21;\">Så glade vi er for at du har registrert deg! Kontoen din er klar, og vi ber om at fellesskapet blir til velsignelse for deg.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.65;color:#151a21;\">Dette kan du gjøre på Min side</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 24px;\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 12px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;width:28px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#fbf1e8;color:#cc712b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;line-height:24px;text-align:center;\">1</div></td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#151a21;\"><strong>Leseplaner</strong> – følg planene dine og se hvor langt du har kommet.</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 12px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;width:28px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#fbf1e8;color:#cc712b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;line-height:24px;text-align:center;\">2</div></td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#151a21;\"><strong>Kurs</strong> – meld deg på bibelkurs og fortsett der du slapp.</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 12px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;width:28px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#fbf1e8;color:#cc712b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;line-height:24px;text-align:center;\">3</div></td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#151a21;\"><strong>Profilen din</strong> – hold kontaktinformasjon og varsler oppdatert.</td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"display:inline-table;margin:0 8px 8px 0;\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#cc712b\" style=\"border-radius:12px;\"><a href=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/minside\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:12px;\">Gå til Min side</a></td></tr></table>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:0 32px 28px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n    <td style=\"border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;padding-top:20px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#151a21;\">Vennlig hilsen<br><strong>His Kingdom Ministry</strong></td>\n  </tr></table></td></tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:22px 8px 8px;text-align:center;\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#151a21;\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/\" style=\"color:#151a21;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">Nettsiden</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/minside\" style=\"color:#151a21;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">Min side</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/kontakt\" style=\"color:#151a21;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">Kontakt</a>\n  </p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#596069;\">Du får denne e-posten fordi du har opprettet en konto på hiskingdomministry.no.<br>© 2026 His Kingdom Ministry</p>\n</td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></table>\n</div>"}, "course_registration": {"subject": "Bekreftelse på kurspåmelding: {{courseTitle}}", "body": "<div class=\"hkm-email-container\" style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f5ed;\"><!-- hkm-design-2026 #FCF9F5 -->\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;\">Takk for påmeldingen! Her er hva som skjer videre.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f5f5ed\" style=\"background:#f5f5ed;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;\">\n<tr><td style=\"padding:0 4px 16px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n  <td><img src=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/img/logo-hkm.png\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;border-radius:50%;\"></td>\n  <td style=\"padding-left:10px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#151a21;\">His Kingdom Ministry</td>\n</tr></table></td></tr>\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid #e6e4dc;\">\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n    <td bgcolor=\"#151a21\" style=\"background:#151a21;border-radius:20px 20px 0 0;padding:30px 32px 28px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffffff;\">Kurspåmelding</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:28px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#ffffff;\">Takk for <span style=\"color:#cc712b;\">påmeldingen</span>!</p>\n    </td></tr></table>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"padding:32px 32px 24px;\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#151a21;\">Hei {{name}}!</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#151a21;\">Takk for at du meldte deg på kurset vårt. Vi gleder oss til å følge deg på denne reisen!</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;\"><tr><td style=\"background:#f5f5ed;border-left:4px solid #cc712b;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:20px 22px;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a0531a;\">Kurs</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700;color:#151a21;\">{{courseTitle}}</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 0px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#596069;\">Vi har registrert påmeldingen din.</p></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.65;color:#151a21;\">Hva skjer videre?</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 24px;\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 12px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;width:28px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#fbf1e8;color:#cc712b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;line-height:24px;text-align:center;\">1</div></td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#151a21;\"><strong>Gratis eller betalt?</strong> Da kan du logge inn på Min side og starte med en gang.</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 12px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;width:28px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#fbf1e8;color:#cc712b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;line-height:24px;text-align:center;\">2</div></td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#151a21;\"><strong>Venter betalingen?</strong> Kurset åpnes så snart betalingen er registrert.</td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"display:inline-table;margin:0 8px 8px 0;\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#cc712b\" style=\"border-radius:12px;\"><a href=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/minside\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:12px;\">Start kurset</a></td></tr></table>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:0 32px 28px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n    <td style=\"border-top:1px solid #e6e4dc;padding-top:20px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#151a21;\">Vennlig hilsen<br><strong>His Kingdom Ministry</strong></td>\n  </tr></table></td></tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:22px 8px 8px;text-align:center;\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#151a21;\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/\" style=\"color:#151a21;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">Nettsiden</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/minside\" style=\"color:#151a21;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">Min side</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"https://www.hiskingdomministry.no/kontakt\" style=\"color:#151a21;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">Kontakt</a>\n  </p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#596069;\">Du får denne e-posten fordi du meldte deg på et kurs hos His Kingdom Ministry.<br>© 2026 His Kingdom Ministry</p>\n</td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></table>\n</div>"}}